#: includes/features/class-seoprostack-editor-access.php:149
msgid "Editors use the business plugins"
msgstr "Toimetajad kasutavad äripluginaid"

# machine translation
#: includes/features/class-seoprostack-editor-access.php:150
msgid "Let editors use WooCommerce as shop managers do, Fluent Forms’ forms and entries, and Rank Math, Tutor LMS and the other Fluent plugins as administrators do. They can see these plugins’ settings, FluentSMTP and its email logs, but changing settings asks them to ask an administrator; settings that show passwords or keys stay for administrators. WordPress’s own settings, plugins, themes and users stay for administrators. Nothing is stored: switch it off and editors have only what their role gives."
msgstr "Laske toimetajatel kasutada WooCommerce nagu kaupluse juhatajad, Fluent Forms-i vorme ja kandeid ning Rank Math, Tutor LMS-i ja teisi Fluent pluginaid administraatoritena. Nad näevad nende pluginate seadeid, FluentSMTP-d ja selle e-posti logisid, kuid sätete muutmiseks palutakse neil administraatorilt küsida; paroole või võtmeid kuvavad seaded jäävad administraatoritele. WordPress-i enda seaded, pluginad, teemad ja kasutajad jäävad administraatoritele. Midagi ei salvestata: lülitage see välja ja toimetajatel on ainult see, mida nende roll annab."

# machine translation
#: includes/features/class-seoprostack-editor-access.php:156
msgid "Roles"
msgstr "Rollid"

# machine translation
#: includes/features/class-seoprostack-editor-access.php:157
msgid "Roles that get the plugins below. Roles that can manage options have them already."
msgstr "Rollid, mis saavad allolevad pluginad. Rollidel, mis saavad valikuid hallata, on need juba olemas."

# machine translation
#: includes/features/class-seoprostack-editor-access.php:165
msgid "In WooCommerce the roles above can do what shop managers can. In Fluent Forms, work with forms, entries and payments, but not its settings. In FluentSMTP, see its dashboard and email logs and resend failed emails, but not change its settings. In the others, what administrators can, except install add-ons, change settings and, in Rank Math, change who can do what."
msgstr "WooCommerce is saavad ülaltoodud rollid teha seda, mida saavad poejuhid. Fluent Forms is saavad nad töötada vormide, kannete ja maksetega, kuid mitte selle sätetega. FluentSMTP-s näevad nad selle armatuurlauda ja meililogisid ning saadavad ebaõnnestunud meile uuesti, kuid ei saa muuta selle sätteid. Teistes rollides saavad administraatorid muuta sätteid, välja arvatud lisandmoodulite installimine ja Rank Math is seda, kes mida saab teha."

# machine translation
#: includes/features/class-seoprostack-editor-access.php:621
msgid "You can see FluentSMTP’s connections and email logs, and resend failed emails. If something here needs changing, please ask an administrator: settings you change here are not saved."
msgstr "Näete FluentSMTP ühendusi ja meililogisid ning saate ebaõnnestunud meile uuesti saata. Kui siin on vaja midagi muuta, pöörduge administraatori poole: siin muudetud sätteid ei salvestata."

# machine translation
#: includes/features/class-seoprostack-editor-access.php:631
msgid "Only an administrator can change FluentSMTP’s settings. If you think something needs updating, please ask one."
msgstr "Ainult administraator saab FluentSMTP seadeid muuta. Kui arvate, et midagi vajab värskendamist, küsige palun administraatorilt."

