#, php-format
msgid "Once a day, download Wordfence Intelligence’s free vulnerability feed (about 80 MB) and match it on this server against the installed plugins, themes and WordPress, including premium plugins. Matches show under Known vulnerabilities and in Tools → Site Health. Needs a free Wordfence Intelligence API key in wp-config.php as %1$s; only the key is sent. Wordfence allows a key few downloads, so sites sharing a key need the same folder in %2$s, where one download serves them all. On a network, the main site checks for all sites."
msgstr "Laadige kord päevas alla Wordfence Intelligence'i tasuta haavatavuste voog (umbes 80 MB) ja leidke sellel serveril vaste installitud pluginate, teemade ja WordPress, sh premium-pluginatega. Vasted kuvatakse teadaolevate haavatavuste all ja menüüs Tööriistad → Saidi tervis. Vajab tasuta Wordfence Intelligence'i API-võtit wp-config.php-s kujul %1$s; saadetakse ainult võti. Wordfence lubab võtit vähe alla laadida, seega vajavad võtit jagavad saidid sama kausta %2$s, kus üks allalaadimine teenindab neid kõiki. Võrgus kontrollib peamine sait kõiki saite."

